{"id":"ustoyat_","lemma":"устоять","pos":"verb","rank":3732,"glosses":["to keep one's balance, to remain on one's feet, to stand one's ground, to stand fast","to resist, to withstand, to stand up (against)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/Ru-%D1%83%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%8F%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D1%8F%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"устою","2s":"устоишь","3s":"устоит","1p":"устоим","2p":"устоите","3p":"устоят"}}},"past":{"m":"устоял","p":"устояли","f":"устояла","n":"устояло"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"устаивать","examples":[{"text":"Никто не может устоять.","en":"No one can resist.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null]},{"text":"Как я мог устоять?","en":"How could I resist?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null]},{"text":"Я не могу устоять.","en":"I can't resist.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null]},{"text":"Том не устоял перед искушением.","en":"Tom was unable to resist the temptation.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"in front of, before"},null]},{"text":"Ты можешь устоять на голове больше трёх минут?","en":"Can you stand on your head for more than three minutes?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"on / at"},null,{"g":"any more"},{"g":"three","l":"три"},null]}]}